OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant pressure' on
OL,4,Ahomelessness services - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demand for housing and homelessness
OL,7,Fsupport in Leeds is higher than in
OL,8,Fcomparable areas and is placing
OL,9,F"significant pressure on the system",
OL,10,Fthe city's council has warned.
OL,12,FThe local authority said there were not
OL,13,Fenough suitable and affordable homes to
OL,14,Fmeet demand, meaning more people were
OL,15,Fusing temporary accommodation and
OL,16,Fsleeping rough.
OL,18,FNatalie Clark, chief executive of Leeds
OL,19,Fcharity Simon on the Streets, which
OL,20,Foffers support to the homeless, said
OL,21,Fthe problem had "absolutely" worsened.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
