OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant pressure' on
OL,4,Ahomelessness services - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat has been described as an
OL,7,F"ambitious" plan to end homelessness in
OL,8,FLeeds is expected to be presented at a
OL,9,Fcouncil meeting later, following the
OL,10,Fprime minister's pledge to "get
OL,11,Feveryone in for Christmas".
